OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACharles 'sounded giddily elated' after
OL,4,ADiana died, Earl Spencer claims
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said: "While we do not
OL,7,Fcomment on books as a matter of
OL,8,Fprinciple, His Majesty is mindful that
OL,9,Fthe pain of fraternal grief can cloud
OL,10,Freason, affect judgment and colour
OL,11,Fmemory in ways others do not recognise,
OL,12,Feven many years after such a loss."
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
