OL,3,AHyrox athlete apologises for continuing
OL,4,Arace after soiling herself
OL,5,
OL,6,FFootage of Wietrzyk competing after
OL,7,Fsoiling herself raised concerns about
OL,8,Fhygiene, leading Hyrox co-founder
OL,9,FMoritz Furste to apologise for the
OL,10,Fhandling of the situation.
OL,12,FIn a statement shared on Thursday,
OL,13,FWietrzyk said: "I know my actions had
OL,14,Fan impact beyond myself, and I am
OL,15,Fgenuinely sorry to everyone who was
OL,16,Faffected."
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
